@startuml
' Stage 0.6 DropOldestItem 정책 시퀀스

participant Producer
participant "BoundedPointerQueue" as Queue
participant Consumer

== 정상 삽입 ==
Producer -> Queue : push(new_item)
Queue --> Producer : Success

== 가득 참 (DropOldestItem) ==
Producer -> Queue : push(new_item)
Queue -> Queue : pop_front()
Queue -> Queue : push_back(new_item)
Queue --> Producer : Success + dropped_old_pointer

Producer -> Consumer : release(dropped_old_pointer)

@enduml
